WEBVTT

00:00.320 --> 00:05.000
Everything that transpired was an insidious trap laid by treacherous conspirators!

00:06.520 --> 00:08.500
Your son is innocent!

00:09.560 --> 00:14.500
Mother believes you! Mother knows you could never commit such treasonous impiety!

00:15.520 --> 00:18.500
Fret not—Mother will protect you!
